From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeremy Barnum <prefer not to supply>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:38:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Keep the owner of a connect made inside didDisconnect

On a disconnect or a failed connect, ImpossiBLE told the app and then
forgot which central owns the peripheral. An app that connects again from
inside that callback, as OmnipodKit's auto-reconnect does, had its new
owner forgotten at once: when the connect later went through, the
peripheral's service and characteristic results found no owner and were
dropped, so the app waited on discovery forever and every command to the
pod was refused. CoreBluetooth has no such ordering. The owner is now
forgotten before the app is told.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Sources/ImpossiBLE/CBSActivator.m | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Sources/ImpossiBLE/CBSActivator.m b/Sources/ImpossiBLE/CBSActivator.m
index 219855a..3e524e1 100644
--- a/Sources/ImpossiBLE/CBSActivator.m
+++ b/Sources/ImpossiBLE/CBSActivator.m
@@ -988,20 +988,21 @@ static void cbs_handle_message(NSDictionary *msg) {
                 [delegate centralManager:central didConnectPeripheral:cbPeripheral];
             } else if ([type isEqualToString:@"didFailConnect"] &&
                        [delegate respondsToSelector:@selector(centralManager:didFailToConnectPeripheral:error:)]) {
-                [delegate centralManager:central didFailToConnectPeripheral:cbPeripheral error:err];
+                // Forgotten before the app hears, so a connect it makes in the callback keeps its owner.
                 [gPeripheralOwners removeObjectForKey:uuid];
+                [delegate centralManager:central didFailToConnectPeripheral:cbPeripheral error:err];
             } else if ([type isEqualToString:@"didDisconnect"] &&
                        [delegate respondsToSelector:@selector(centralManager:didDisconnectPeripheral:timestamp:isReconnecting:error:)]) {
+                [gPeripheralOwners removeObjectForKey:uuid];
                 [delegate centralManager:central
                    didDisconnectPeripheral:cbPeripheral
                                 timestamp:timestamp
                            isReconnecting:isReconnecting
                                     error:err];
-                [gPeripheralOwners removeObjectForKey:uuid];
             } else if ([type isEqualToString:@"didDisconnect"] &&
                        [delegate respondsToSelector:@selector(centralManager:didDisconnectPeripheral:error:)]) {
-                [delegate centralManager:central didDisconnectPeripheral:cbPeripheral error:err];
                 [gPeripheralOwners removeObjectForKey:uuid];
+                [delegate centralManager:central didDisconnectPeripheral:cbPeripheral error:err];
             }
         });
         return;
